<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Eletrobras starts.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Eletrobras starts.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Caspian Securities said on Tuesday it started coverage of Brazilian utility holding Centrais Eletricas Brasileiras SA, or Eletrobras, with a rating of market performer.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Silvia Sandoval, Rowe Michels and Alison Graham in a Feb 6 analysis set a 12-month price target of $491.20 per 1,000 shares, representing a dollar return of 15 percent including a dividend yield of 1.3 percent.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
